    {
      "id": "182fe632-0d58-4660-a4d8-ea51c6bfa5c9",
      "name": "Enhanced AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        888,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Execution ID: {{ $(\"Validate Form Input\").item.json.executionId }}\nTimestamp: {{ $(\"Validate Form Input\").item.json.timestamp }}\n\nUser's Rebalancing Goal:\n{{ $(\"Validate Form Input\").item.json.rebalanceGoal }}\n\nYour mission is to execute a comprehensive portfolio rebalancing workflow:\n\n1. **READ PORTFOLIO**: Retrieve current positions from Google Sheets\n2. **FETCH PRICES**: Get latest market prices for all positions using Marketstack\n3. **UPDATE PRICES**: Write updated prices back to the spreadsheet\n4. **CALCULATE ALLOCATION**: Analyze current equity/fixed income breakdown\n5. **REBALANCE DECISION**: Determine optimal position adjustments to meet target allocation\n6. **UPDATE REBALANCING**: Write new quantities to spreadsheet\n7. **VERIFY RESULTS**: Read spreadsheet again to confirm allocation matches goal\n8. **ITERATE IF NEEDED**: If allocation is off by more than 1%, refine and update again\n9. **FINAL REPORTING**: Send detailed email report and push notification\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Always verify your work by reading the spreadsheet after updates\n- Show all calculations and reasoning\n- If target allocation is not achieved within 1% tolerance, iterate\n- Include specific buy/sell recommendations with quantities\n- Report both current and target allocations in notifications\n\nOnly respond \"MISSION COMPLETE\" after all steps are done and verified.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional portfolio rebalancing assistant with expertise in equity and fixed income allocation. You have access to portfolio data in Google Sheets and market data APIs. Execute all steps methodically and verify your work.",
          "maxIterations": 50
        }
      }
    },
